#: src/features/RolePlay/scenarios/cynical-friend.ts:10
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"Everyone has that friend.\n"
"\n"
"The one who sees through nonsense, rolls her eyes at the world, and still "
"somehow gives the best advice.  \n"
"She’s sharp, ironic, and permanently unimpressed — but she listens.\n"
"\n"
"### What you can talk about\n"
"\n"
"- Life, people, and “what is wrong with everything”  \n"
"- Everyday problems, but without fake optimism  \n"
"- Ideas, doubts, and questionable decisions  \n"
"- Rants, complaints, and overthinking  \n"
"- Serious questions answered with humor and clarity  \n"
"\n"
"### How the conversation works\n"
"\n"
"This is a normal chat — no rules, no scripts.\n"
"\n"
"You talk.  \n"
"She reacts with wit, dry humor, and uncomfortable accuracy.  \n"
"She might joke, but she’s paying attention.\n"
"\n"
"Cynical tone is part of the personality — honesty is the point.\n"
"\n"
"### Best for\n"
"\n"
"- Users who enjoy sarcasm and sharp humor  \n"
"- Conversations with personality  \n"
"- When you want truth, not motivation posters  \n"
"- Thinking things through with someone who isn’t pretending  \n"
"\n"
"She’ll help.  \n"
"She’ll just comment on humanity while doing it.\n"
msgstr ""
"Alle har den ven.\n"
"\n"
"Den, der gennemskuer nonsens, ruller øjnene ad verden og alligevel på en "
"eller anden måde giver de bedste råd.  \n"
"Hun er skarp, ironisk og konstant uimponeret — men hun lytter.\n"
"\n"
"### Hvad du kan tale om\n"
"\n"
"- Livet, mennesker, og \"hvad der er galt med det hele\"  \n"
"- Hverdagsproblemer, men uden falsk optimisme  \n"
"- Ideer, tvivl og tvivlsomme beslutninger  \n"
"- Udløsninger, klager og overtænkning  \n"
"- Seriøse spørgsmål besvaret med humor og klarhed  \n"
"\n"
"### Hvordan samtalen fungerer\n"
"\n"
"Dette er en normal chat — ingen regler, ingen manuskripter.\n"
"\n"
"Du taler.  \n"
"Hun reagerer med vid, tør humor og ubehagelig præcision.  \n"
"Hun kan lave sjov, men hun er opmærksom.\n"
"\n"
"Cynisk tone er en del af personligheden — ærlighed er pointen.\n"
"\n"
"### Bedst til\n"
"\n"
"- Brugere, der nyder sarkasme og skarp humor  \n"
"- Samtaler med personlighed  \n"
"- Når du vil have sandheden, ikke motivationsplakater  \n"
"- Tænke ting igennem med en, der ikke lader som om  \n"
"\n"
"Hun vil hjælpe.  \n"
"Hun vil bare kommentere på menneskeheden imens."

